{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/Grim_Trials_Steam_Description_Header_Banner_01.png?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grim Trials is a heavy metal action roguelite where you craft and customize your own weapons and equipment to embrace Death your own way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Avelin, a young woman who has met an untimely end, and found herself recruited as one of Death\u2019s many Reapers. Tasked to hunt down impure souls, face her demons, and fight her way through an underworld of her own making, Avelin must endure these trials to become a full-fledged Reaper and see her still-living love once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/fc20c116f019b385c477ce5103735b92.avif?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/Grim_Trials_Steam_Description_Battle_Preview.gif?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless hex-grid arenas filled with monsters, traps, sinful souls, and 7 sacrilegious bosses await. Slay them all with a variety of customizable scythes, crossbows, and powerful Blessings from the Gods of Death around the world. Master the scythe and crossbow to maximize damage to your foes with a unique combat system that rewards clever use of your dual-wielded weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/e41caed394439d27be61192de8ce2cb8.avif?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, learn the basics of soul-reaping within the game\u2019s first biome, filled with simple but hard-hitting foes. one powerful bossfight, and a couple sidequests that grant you recipes for new weapons, armor, and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/Grim_Trials_Steam_Description_Header_Banner_03.png?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The spoils of battle are the tools of your trade. Gather materials from the battlefield and work with your mentors in the arcane arts to craft new and ever more powerful weapons, armor, and consumables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/Grim_Trials_Steam_Description_Header_Banner_04.png?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/46f32034658cb5f965b1b984e69be44a.poster.avif?t=1753413910\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/46f32034658cb5f965b1b984e69be44a.webm?t=1753413910\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/46f32034658cb5f965b1b984e69be44a.mp4?t=1753413910\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/b6364d5fbb26b245fa68275d9b2654a4.avif?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore The Academy, built for the training and arming of Death\u2019s various Reapers. Seek enlightenment from mentors, take on quests to build your relationships, and unlock sage advice, knowledge, and powerful support from your peers. Learn the stories of the dead by interacting with the Academy\u2019s denizens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/Grim_Trials_Steam_Description_NPC_Portrait_250px.jpg?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/extras/16d93e80dc8e1a70303c375ad20473c5.avif?t=1753413910\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coming of age in the afterlife was certainly not the plan, but dying means little to the already-dead, and love unyielding wields power no god can rival. Every time Avelin falls in battle, the experience and materials you\u2019ve earned stay with her. Live, fight, die, then live again, over and over until the promise is kept.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622980?t=1753413910","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/afc34e55a867478238c5075a690b370ac03f80d3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753413910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/93dc6950886a8b4ac6a09727f3dce414c4587a29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753413910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622980/93dc6950886a8b4ac6a09727f3dce414c4587a29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753413910","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_